{"seq":1,"slug":"heightmaps-representation","title":"高度场与地形表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/foundations/heightmaps-representation","wordCount":1451,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"高度场与地形表示\">高度场与地形表示</h1><p>打开任何一款商业引擎的地形编辑器，你拿到的第一份数据几乎都是一张灰度图：亮的地方高、暗的地方低。这种&quot;用一张二维标量场描述地表起伏&quot;的表示，就是高度场（heightfield）。它统治地形领域不是因为最强大，而是因为它把一个三维问题压成了二维——而二维数据恰好是 GPU、压缩算法、流送系统都最擅长处理的东西。理解高度场能做什么、做不到什么，是后面每一章的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从二维标量到三维表面\">核心概念：从二维标量到三维表面</h2><p>高度场把地形表面建模为一个函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(x, z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：给定平面上的网格坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，返回该处的高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。在实现上它就是一张分辨率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的图，每个像素存一个高度值。把相邻四个采样点连成两个三角形，整张图就展开成一片连续网格。</p>\n<p>这种表示的根本约束在于：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 只有<strong>唯一</strong>的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着高度场天然无法表达竖直悬崖之外的任何&quot;上下叠合&quot;结构——洞穴、拱门、悬挑的岩檐、内部中空的山体，在高度场里都不存在。这是它最大的局限，也是 <a href=\"voxel-vs-heightfield\">体素方案</a> 存在的唯一理由。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[高度图 N×N&lt;br/&gt;灰度标量场 h] --&gt; B[采样为网格顶点&lt;br/&gt;x,z 已知 y 查表]&#10;    B --&gt; C[相邻四点三角化&lt;br/&gt;每格两个三角形]&#10;    C --&gt; D[派生法线/坡度&lt;br/&gt;由邻域差分计算]&#10;    D --&gt; E[送入地形管线&lt;br/&gt;剔除 LOD 着色]&#10;    A --&gt; F{能表达?}&#10;    F --&gt;|可以| G[起伏 山谷 平原 河床]&#10;    F --&gt;|不可以| H[洞穴 拱门 悬挑 中空]\">flowchart TD\n    A[高度图 N×N&lt;br/&gt;灰度标量场 h] --&gt; B[采样为网格顶点&lt;br/&gt;x,z 已知 y 查表]\n    B --&gt; C[相邻四点三角化&lt;br/&gt;每格两个三角形]\n    C --&gt; D[派生法线/坡度&lt;br/&gt;由邻域差分计算]\n    D --&gt; E[送入地形管线&lt;br/&gt;剔除 LOD 着色]\n    A --&gt; F{能表达?}\n    F --&gt;|可以| G[起伏 山谷 平原 河床]\n    F --&gt;|不可以| H[洞穴 拱门 悬挑 中空]</pre><p>下表对比地形几种常见的几何表示在关键维度上的差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方式</th>\n<th>存储成本</th>\n<th>能否悬挑/洞穴</th>\n<th>LOD 难度</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高度场（heightfield）</td>\n<td>低（2D 标量）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低（结构规则）</td>\n<td>绝大多数开放世界地表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角网格（free mesh）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高（无规则结构）</td>\n<td>手工雕刻的特殊地貌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体素（voxel/SDF）</td>\n<td>极高（3D 密度场）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可破坏地形、星球内部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高度场 + 网格叠加</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>局部是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高度场打底 + 洞穴用网格补</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"高度的数值精度-8-位的灾难与-16-位的常识\">高度的数值精度：8 位的灾难与 16 位的常识</h2><p>高度图存什么数值类型，直接决定地形会不会出现肉眼可见的&quot;台阶&quot;。8 位灰度只有 256 个高度档位：若地形垂直跨度是 1000 米，那么相邻档位之间就是约 3.9 米的硬跳变，平缓的山坡会变成一级级的梯田。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta h = \\frac{h_{max} - h_{min}}{2^{b} - 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是位深。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>、跨度 1000 米，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.015</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta h \\approx 0.015</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.015</span></span></span></span></span> 米——1.5 厘米的高度分辨率，对绝大多数游戏已经够细。因此 16 位无符号整数（R16）是商业引擎的事实标准；需要负高度或更高动态范围时用 16/32 位浮点。这也是为什么从 Photoshop 导出地形高度图时，务必选 16 位灰度而非默认的 8 位——这是新手最常见的踩坑点之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"派生属性-法线-坡度与曲率\">派生属性：法线、坡度与曲率</h2><p>地形的光照、材质混合、可行走性判定，几乎都不直接用高度本身，而用从高度场算出的派生量。最重要的是<strong>法线</strong>。在规则网格上，可用相邻采样点的中心差分近似切向量再叉乘：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n} = \\left( h_{x-1} - h_{x+1},\\; 2s,\\; h_{z-1} - h_{z+1} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是采样间距（格距）。归一化后即为该点的表面法线。<strong>坡度</strong>则是法线与竖直方向的夹角，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>slope</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>arccos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{slope} = \\arccos(n_y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slope</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arccos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它直接驱动 <a href=\"../shading/terrain-texture-splatting\">纹理混合</a> 里&quot;陡坡刷岩石、缓坡刷草地&quot;的规则，也决定角色能否在此处行走。</p>\n<p>这些派生量既可以离线烘焙成贴图（省运行时计算），也可以在着色器里实时算（省显存、支持动态地形）。可破坏或位移的地形必须实时算，否则法线会与变形后的几何对不上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表示的边界-何时高度场就不够用了\">表示的边界：何时高度场就不够用了</h2><p>高度场的优雅来自它的规则性，但项目里总有它兜不住的地貌。常见的混合策略是&quot;高度场打底，特殊结构叠网格&quot;：主地表仍用高度场享受全部 LOD 与流送红利，洞穴入口、天然拱门这类局部用独立的网格资产覆盖上去，二者在视觉上拼接。这比全盘换成体素便宜得多，是当前开放世界的主流折中。</p>\n<p>另一种边界是<strong>极大尺度</strong>。行星级地形（如《微软模拟飞行》）无法用单张平面高度图，因为球面无法无畸变地展开成平面。这类系统用立方体球（cube-sphere）把球面分成六个面，每个面再用四叉树高度场细分——本质仍是高度场，只是把&quot;一张图&quot;换成了&quot;六棵高度场四叉树&quot;，细节见 <a href=\"../lod/terrain-streaming\">大世界分块流送</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>高度场把地形建模为二维标量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(x,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，规则、易压缩、易 LOD，是商业引擎的事实标准。</li>\n<li>它的根本局限是每个平面位置只有唯一高度，无法表达洞穴、拱门、悬挑——这是体素方案存在的理由。</li>\n<li>高度数值至少用 16 位（R16），8 位会产生肉眼可见的高度台阶。</li>\n<li>法线、坡度、曲率等派生量驱动光照、材质混合与可行走判定，动态地形必须实时计算。</li>\n<li>实践中常用&quot;高度场打底 + 局部网格/体素补洞&quot;的混合方案；行星尺度则用立方体球上的多棵高度场四叉树。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇：<a href=\"terrain-pipeline\">地形渲染管线</a>——这张高度场如何一步步变成屏幕像素。</li>\n<li>高度场的另一面：<a href=\"voxel-vs-heightfield\">体素与高度场之争</a>——当你真的需要洞穴和可破坏地形时。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../procedural-content-generation/terrain-space/heightmap-terrain\">PCG · 高度图地形生成</a>——这张高度图最初是怎么被程序化生成出来的。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高度场与地形表示","id":"高度场与地形表示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从二维标量到三维表面","id":"核心概念-从二维标量到三维表面"},{"level":2,"text":"高度的数值精度：8 位的灾难与 16 位的常识","id":"高度的数值精度-8-位的灾难与-16-位的常识"},{"level":2,"text":"派生属性：法线、坡度与曲率","id":"派生属性-法线-坡度与曲率"},{"level":2,"text":"表示的边界：何时高度场就不够用了","id":"表示的边界-何时高度场就不够用了"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"地形渲染管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/foundations/terrain-pipeline"}}